### ---------- Timestamps ----------
### Run "npm run seed" first: all seeded rows get the same createdAt

### 24. A product shows both dates, in UTC (ending with Z)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 25. Newest first (expect ids 30, 29, 28)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=createdAt&order=desc&limit=3

### 26. Oldest first (expect ids 1, 2, 3)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=createdAt&order=asc&limit=3

### 27. Edit a product (expect updatedAt to move forward, createdAt to stay the same)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 26
}

### 28. Same value again (expect updatedAt NOT to change, nothing was different)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 26
}